dsh-desktop (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of dsh-desktop for Ubuntu and Zorin OS.
  * Standalone application window wrapper for @deepseek-ai/dsh.
  * Direct --expose-internals inline node flag execution to bypass NODE_OPTIONS restriction.
  * Automated sharp-linux-x64 native binding linking.
  * Safe default profile initialization with package.json race prevention.
  * Systemd user service dsh-desktop.service and XDG desktop entry.
  * Native system tray icon with backend status, restart, and quit controls.

 -- RidgeBridgeStudios <RidgeBridgeStudios@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:30:00 +0200
